      "accepted REF-YYZ-6DOF-CORE-001 rigid-body equations and RK4 policy"
    ],
    "implemented_scope": "One fixture-local sampled boundary and one FrozenInterval compose the accepted environment, air-data, aero, propulsion, current MassProperties, Closure and rigid-core profiles into an executable trajectory.",
    "temporal_policy": "Every sampled input has tick 0 identity. The closure and current mass are frozen on [0,1); the scalar mass candidate remains candidate-only until tick 1.",
    "trajectory_policy": "The accepted case has zero total moment and zero angular rate, so the held body force has constant inertial coordinates. A one-step classical RK4 result is checked against the exact constant-acceleration trajectory.",
    "excluded": [
      "canonical mission, vehicle, environment, atmosphere, aero or propulsion assets",
      "coefficient lookup, command mapping, control, guidance and product termination metrics",
      "a committed center-of-mass or inertia evolution law",
      "R1-R8 product contracts or runtime capability"
    ]
  },
  "model": {
