      "all supplied and derived physical values are finite",
      "sample tick and configuration revision are nonnegative integers",
      "sample_tick = valid_from_tick and valid_until_tick = sample_tick + 1",
      "base_dt_s > 0, density >= 0 and speed_of_sound > 0",
      "current mass and scalar mass candidate are strictly positive",
      "thrust is nonnegative and its direction is unit length",
      "q_I_B has nonzero norm and inertia about the CoM is symmetric positive definite"
    ]
  },
